### ===========================================
### Authentication Endpoints
### ===========================================

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

### Register - minimal (just email and password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "minimal@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### Get current user profile (requires auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh access token (requires valid token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Logout (requires auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===========================================
### Password Reset Flow
### ===========================================

### Request password reset email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Reset password with token (get token from email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "RESET_TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL",
  "password": "NewSecurePass456"
}

### ===========================================
### Error Cases (for testing)
### ===========================================

### Register - duplicate email (should return 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "AnotherPass123"
}

### Register - invalid email format (should return 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### Register - password too short (should return 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "short"
}

### Login - wrong password (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

### Login - non-existent user (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### Get profile without token (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
